{"code": 200, "status": "OK", "data": [{"number": 97, "name": "سُورَةُ القَدۡرِ", "englishName": "Al-Qadr", "englishNameTranslation": "The Power, Fate", "revelationType": "Meccan", "numberOfAyahs": 5, "ayahs": [{"number": 6126, "text": "بِّسْمِ ٱللَّهِ ٱلرَّحْمَٰنِ ٱلرَّحِيمِ إِنَّآ أَنزَلْنَٰهُ فِى لَيْلَةِ ٱلْقَدْرِ", "numberInSurah": 1, "juz": 30, "manzil": 7, "page": 598, "ruku": 539, "hizbQuarter": 239, "sajda": false}, {"number": 6127, "text": "وَمَآ أَدْرَىٰكَ مَا لَيْلَةُ ٱلْقَدْرِ", "numberInSurah": 2, "juz": 30, "manzil": 7, "page": 598, "ruku": 539, "hizbQuarter": 239, "sajda": false}, {"number": 6128, "text": "لَيْلَةُ ٱلْقَدْرِ خَيْرٌۭ مِّنْ أَلْفِ شَهْرٍۢ", "numberInSurah": 3, "juz": 30, "manzil": 7, "page": 598, "ruku": 539, "hizbQuarter": 239, "sajda": false}, {"number": 6129, "text": "تَنَزَّلُ ٱلْمَلَٰٓئِكَةُ وَٱلرُّوحُ فِيهَا بِإِذْنِ رَبِّهِم مِّن كُلِّ أَمْرٍۢ", "numberInSurah": 4, "juz": 30, "manzil": 7, "page": 598, "ruku": 539, "hizbQuarter": 239, "sajda": false}, {"number": 6130, "text": "سَلَٰمٌ هِىَ حَتَّىٰ مَطْلَعِ ٱلْفَجْرِ", "numberInSurah": 5, "juz": 30, "manzil": 7, "page": 598, "ruku": 539, "hizbQuarter": 239, "sajda": false}], "edition": {"identifier": "quran-uthmani", "language": "ar", "name": "القرآن الكريم برسم العثماني (uthmani)", "englishName": "Uthmani", "format": "text", "type": "quran", "direction": "rtl"}}, {"number": 97, "name": "سُورَةُ القَدۡرِ", "englishName": "Al-Qadr", "englishNameTranslation": "The Power, Fate", "revelationType": "Meccan", "numberOfAyahs": 5, "ayahs": [{"number": 6126, "text": "Воистину, Мы ниспослали его (Коран) в ночь предопределения (или величия).", "numberInSurah": 1, "juz": 30, "manzil": 7, "page": 598, "ruku": 539, "hizbQuarter": 239, "sajda": false}, {"number": 6127, "text": "Откуда ты мог знать, что такое ночь предопределения (или величия)?", "numberInSurah": 2, "juz": 30, "manzil": 7, "page": 598, "ruku": 539, "hizbQuarter": 239, "sajda": false}, {"number": 6128, "text": "Ночь предопределения (или величия) лучше тысячи месяцев.", "numberInSurah": 3, "juz": 30, "manzil": 7, "page": 598, "ruku": 539, "hizbQuarter": 239, "sajda": false}, {"number": 6129, "text": "В эту ночь ангелы и Дух (Джибрил) нисходят с дозволения их Господа по всем Его повелениям.", "numberInSurah": 4, "juz": 30, "manzil": 7, "page": 598, "ruku": 539, "hizbQuarter": 239, "sajda": false}, {"number": 6130, "text": "Она благополучна вплоть до наступления зари.", "numberInSurah": 5, "juz": 30, "manzil": 7, "page": 598, "ruku": 539, "hizbQuarter": 239, "sajda": false}], "edition": {"identifier": "ru.kuliev", "language": "ru", "name": "Кулиев", "englishName": "Elmir Kuliev", "format": "text", "type": "translation", "direction": "ltr"}}, {"number": 97, "name": "سُورَةُ القَدۡرِ", "englishName": "Al-Qadr", "englishNameTranslation": "The Power, Fate", "revelationType": "Meccan", "numberOfAyahs": 5, "ayahs": [{"number": 6126, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/6126.mp3", "audioSecondary": ["https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/6126.mp3"], "text": "بِّسْمِ ٱللَّهِ ٱلرَّحْمَٰنِ ٱلرَّحِيمِ إِنَّآ أَنزَلْنَٰهُ فِى لَيْلَةِ ٱلْقَدْرِ", "numberInSurah": 1, "juz": 30, "manzil": 7, "page": 598, "ruku": 539, "hizbQuarter": 239, "sajda": false}, {"number": 6127, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/6127.mp3", "audioSecondary": ["https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/6127.mp3"], "text": "وَمَآ أَدْرَىٰكَ مَا لَيْلَةُ ٱلْقَدْرِ", "numberInSurah": 2, "juz": 30, "manzil": 7, "page": 598, "ruku": 539, "hizbQuarter": 239, "sajda": false}, {"number": 6128, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/6128.mp3", "audioSecondary": ["https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/6128.mp3"], "text": "لَيْلَةُ ٱلْقَدْرِ خَيْرٌۭ مِّنْ أَلْفِ شَهْرٍۢ", "numberInSurah": 3, "juz": 30, "manzil": 7, "page": 598, "ruku": 539, "hizbQuarter": 239, "sajda": false}, {"number": 6129, "audio": "https://cdn.